{"root":{"data":{"id":"djdj7rwskt40","created":1781923650140,"text":"发展全过程人民民主"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdjbdcl4ps0","created":1781923931900,"text":"人民民主是社会主义的生命，全过程人民民主是社会主义民主的本质属性","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdjbv1nlig0","created":1781923970421,"text":"坚定制度自信","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdjd7pjtco0","created":1781924076352,"text":"人民民主是社会主义的生命","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdjc6dgy5c0","created":1781923995080,"text":"中国特色社会主义政治制度行得通、 有生命力、 有效率","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdjc8wybxs0","created":1781924000612,"text":"- 中国特色社会主义政治制度是由根本政治制度、基本政治制度、重要政治制度等组成的制度体系。 ","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdjchsjuyw0","created":1781924019937,"text":"人民代表大会","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdjcjui7ig0","created":1781924024409,"text":"政治协商、民族区域自治、基层群众自治","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djdjc8wy9gg0","created":1781924000612,"text":"- 中国特色社会主义政治制度具有鲜明的中国特色。","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdjc8wyadc0","created":1781924000612,"text":"- 中国特色社会主义政治制度在实践中显示出巨大优势","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djdjd1pbh1k0","created":1781924063277,"text":"坚定不移走中国特色社会主义政治发展道路","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdjdg176s80","created":1781924094470,"text":"- 必须坚持党的领导、 人民当家作主、 依法治国有机统一 。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdjdg16zo80","created":1781924094470,"text":"- 必须积极稳妥推进政治体制改革 。   "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdjdg1767k0","created":1781924094470,"text":"- 必须始终保持政治定力"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"djdjdkasf6o0","created":1781924103757,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}